1
00:00:00,220 --> 00:00:01,544
One hour a day

2
00:00:01,544 --> 00:00:03,056
365 hours a year

3
00:00:03,056 --> 00:00:04,191
Not a slogan

4
00:00:04,191 --> 00:00:06,460
a budget you can compute

5
00:00:06,980 --> 00:00:09,137
Most people run the order backwards

6
00:00:09,137 --> 00:00:10,924
They think they have to grind

7
00:00:10,924 --> 00:00:12,033
twelve hours a day

8
00:00:12,033 --> 00:00:12,958
like their hero

9
00:00:12,958 --> 00:00:14,252
You probably have one

10
00:00:14,772 --> 00:00:15,976
Two numbers first

11
00:00:15,976 --> 00:00:17,392
Conscious processing

12
00:00:17,392 --> 00:00:19,163
about fifty bits a second

13
00:00:19,163 --> 00:00:21,004
what the body runs for you

14
00:00:21,004 --> 00:00:21,996
eleven million

15
00:00:22,516 --> 00:00:23,688
Over a lifetime

16
00:00:23,688 --> 00:00:26,657
a hundred and twenty-five billion bits

17
00:00:26,657 --> 00:00:27,282
In bytes

18
00:00:27,282 --> 00:00:29,548
fifteen point eight gigabytes

19
00:00:30,068 --> 00:00:32,241
Left alone, it only gets messier

20
00:00:32,241 --> 00:00:34,142
A room does not clean itself

21
00:00:34,142 --> 00:00:35,636
Neither does attention

22
00:00:36,156 --> 00:00:38,141
So focus is not willpower

23
00:00:38,141 --> 00:00:40,365
It needs three preconditions

24
00:00:40,365 --> 00:00:42,588
clarity, importance, urgency

25
00:00:43,108 --> 00:00:44,290
And one formula

26
00:00:44,290 --> 00:00:47,049
the task sits just above your skill

27
00:00:47,049 --> 00:00:48,546
Too hard is anxiety

28
00:00:48,546 --> 00:00:50,044
Too easy is boredom

29
00:00:50,564 --> 00:00:52,408
Work comes in three kinds

30
00:00:52,408 --> 00:00:54,694
Building, maintenance, recovery

31
00:00:54,694 --> 00:00:55,505
Build first

32
00:00:55,505 --> 00:00:57,644
Most days are all maintenance

33
00:00:58,164 --> 00:00:59,138
And recovery

34
00:00:59,138 --> 00:01:01,653
Walking, staring, no headphones

35
00:01:01,653 --> 00:01:03,356
The brain is not idle

36
00:01:03,356 --> 00:01:05,628
Ideas form in the background

37
00:01:06,148 --> 00:01:08,038
The frame has five layers

38
00:01:08,038 --> 00:01:09,474
Vision, anti-vision

39
00:01:09,474 --> 00:01:11,666
the goal hierarchy, a project

40
00:01:11,666 --> 00:01:14,236
the lever task, one to three a day

41
00:01:14,756 --> 00:01:17,163
Two weeks with no visible progress

42
00:01:17,163 --> 00:01:19,428
change the lever, not the length

43
00:01:19,428 --> 00:01:19,924
Tonight

44
00:01:19,924 --> 00:01:21,764
keep the hour for yourself
